mtdev translates multitouch protocol events from touchscreens and touchpads into a
stable form; libinput uses it. Installs libmtdev, headers, mtdev.pc and the mtdev-test
tool under /usr/local.
The source is the Ubuntu archive's copy of the upstream release
upstream: https://bitmath.org/code/mtdev/
